        "Id1": {
            "text": "The Year of No Light album Live at Roadburn 2008 was preceded by the album Nord (produced by Year of No Light ) and followed by the album Karysun / Year of No Light. It was produced by Roadburn Festival."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "The album Nord from The Year of No Light was produced by the band then they followed it up with Live at Roadburn 2008 and after that \"Karysun/Year of No Light\" EP which was produced by Roadburn Festival."
        },
        "Id3": {
            "text": "Nord was produced by Year of No Light. The band followed Nord with Live at Roadburn 2008, which was produced by the Roadburn festival. Year of No Light's next album was Karysun / Year of No Light."
        }
